><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/low-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/low-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/low-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Low severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Document Copilot gate release behavior without fallback](#discussion_r4226680469)\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>Previously missed (1)</strong></summary>\n\nIn code that hasn't changed since last review\n\n<details>\n<summary><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Medium severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> Forward the dashboard secret from same-ref canary callers</summary>\n\n`.github/\u200bworkflows/\u200bpull-request-dashboard-repo.yml:28`\n\n`pull-request-dashboard.yml` never forwards this newly declared secret: every current same-ref canary call maps only `PR_DASHBOARD_PRIVATE_KEY` and `SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL`, and reusable-workflow secrets are not inherited implicitly. Consequently the canary `update-dashboard` always sees fallback availability as false and `publish-dashboard` receives an empty token, so configuring the documented organization secret cannot exercise this feature through the legacy entry point. Forward the secret from the same-ref canary callers (while leaving callers pinned to the older workflow unchanged until that workflow is promoted).\n</details>\n</details>\n\n\ud83e\udde0 **Review effort:** Balanced","comment_id":null,"key":"review:5465968743","kind":"body","line":null,"path":null,"review_id":5465968743}],"frozen_at":1791523430,"frozen_at_iso":"2026-10-09T05:23:50Z","frozen_sha":"06b6dae928dc61c493f260723cdf35d030f364f7","head_ref":"trask-copilot-review-loop","head_repo":"open-telemetry/shared-workflows","head_repo_id":1279488627,"input_mode":"direct","launch_run":{"actor_id":218610,"attempt":1,"id":37884850288},"loop_kind":"copilot_review","mode":"publish","pr":452,"protocol":"reviewable-v1","publication":{"auth_mode":"fine_grained_pat","authorized_actor_id":218610,"authorized_at":1791520741,"generation":3,"max_pipelines":5,"phase":"75b132153145437f916a64645a612689","profile":"reviewable-v1","required_checks":[]},"repo":"open-telemetry/shared-workflows","repo_id":1279488627,"request_id":"ee5426c15a344973b3dafa8d086fd08c","schema":2,"source_private":false,"target_private":false,"workflow_ref":"review-loop-revisions/eadecd0ffce9590595791925dd85130dae808235","workflow_revision":"eadecd0ffce9590595791925dd85130dae808235"},"run":{"attempt":1,"conclusion":null,"id":37888519154,"url":"https://github.com/trask/copilot-workflows/actions/runs/37888519154"},"schema":2,"seen_findings":["c2f8fd163056601cdd4b0384d140e0a3fffde63585cd04952d18db559c7ff773","77d8feb32732ee5e767372b1359ec8677fd054439a2c82f247d58fb6211b53b6"],"seen_inline_findings":["89b6523960ef066454cfe0006753d1d5d273c7c39f4935752e9e8d82eb2c83d6","e5c5f0977d9fe4058b67c9a638b818851fb8079e6fc70e6471563363665a564d"],"seen_missed_findings":["a1105715def95e0e2f9db867a29a223403c52c343244349449d6c9032f77d997"],"stage":"running"}